&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryCodigo DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryCodigo :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
    OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK
         WHERE {&TableName}.cdn-tip-carroc >= i-cdn-tip-carroc-ini
           AND {&TableName}.cdn-tip-carroc <= i-cdn-tip-carroc-fim  INDEXED-REPOSITION.
         
    RETURN "OK":U.           
           
END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

